              "type": "text",
              "text": "Daisy earns a gross fortnightly pay of $2802. ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "She earned $4055 this year in interest from her savings. ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "She pays union fees of $900 per year and has other allowable deductions totalling $528. ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What is her annual taxable income?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
